WEBVTT

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.925
conquering kingdoms as far as Africa,

00:00:31.925 --> 00:00:35.704
and even building outposts 
in North America.

00:00:35.704 --> 00:00:39.215
The secret to their success 
was their ships.

00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:41.365
The formidable Viking longship

00:00:41.365 --> 00:00:45.979
had its origins 
in the humble dugout canoe, or log boat.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.039
For millennia,

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:51.495
the inhabitants of Scandinavia 
had used these canoes for transportation.

00:00:51.495 --> 00:00:55.848
Dense forests and tall mountains 
made overland travel difficult,

00:00:55.848 --> 00:01:00.178
but long coastlines 
and numerous rivers, lakes, and fjords